      "docs.csvnote.h": "Why the CSV gets cleared.",
      "docs.csvnote.p": "A signal source with automatic refresh re-reads the file on every cycle: if BetRelay left the old row on disk, the software would put it back in the list even after you deleted it by hand. That's why, once the timeout passes, BetRelay returns the file to header only — it's the guarantee that yesterday's signal never becomes today's bet.",
      "docs.s3": "Official XTrader manual",
